    "title": "Motorcycle, car crash under investigation in Colonie - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Natalie St. Denis ,\n1 hours ago\nCOLONIE, N.Y. ( NEWS10 ) — The Colonie Police Department is investigating a crash that took place on Columbia Street Extension on Wednesday. Authorities say the incident involved a vehicle and a motorcycle.\nColonie police said several people were injured. The roadway was also closed for several hours, but has since reopened.\nGet the latest news, weather, sports and entertainment delivered right to your inbox! The cause of the crash is still under investigation. Stay with NEWS10 as more information becomes available.\nRead the latest from NEWS10:\nNEWS10 is the Capital Region’s local news leader!\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to NEWS10 ABC.",
